    <item>
      <title>Ilya Sutskever的宣言：AI“规模时代”的终结与一场回归本源的智能博弈</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/ilya-sutskeverai-20251126151005449-2/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 15:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
